JA internal identifier of an existing qualification or technical parameter to update;
It must not be specified when creating new parameter for both existing or new section;
If provided and the section doesn’t contain a parameter with such identifier, error is returned and operation aborted.
See §Behavior, section “Envelope Management”.

JA internal identifier of an existing commercial parameter to update;
It must not be specified when creating new parameter for both existing or new section;
If provided and the section doesn’t contain a parameter with such identifier, error is returned and operation aborted.
See §Behavior, section “Envelope Management”.

